/// test/TestArenaDoors.cs
/// Golden: a fingerprint of today's N/S arena (every mesh triangle with its
/// winding, every collision shape's world AABB, every light position) is recorded
/// BEFORE the door-angle refactor with `-- record`, and compared after. 1v1's
